## Pages

- [Home]({{ site_url }}/index.md): About the meetup, upcoming and past events, organisers, community links
- [Events]({{ site_url }}/events/index.md): All meetups, upcoming and past, with talks and speakers, linking to a page per event
- [For speakers]({{ site_url }}/for-speakers/index.md): How to give a talk — formats, topics, schedule, practicalities
- [For companies]({{ site_url }}/for-companies/index.md): How to host or sponsor a meetup

## Feeds

- [JSON feed]({{ site_url }}/events.json): Events as JSON Feed 1.1, with structured event data (times, venue, talks, registration) in a `_pydata_helsinki_event` extension
- [Atom feed]({{ site_url }}/feed.xml)
- [Calendar]({{ site_url }}/events.ics): Events as iCalendar

